# Register a new user
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "testuser1",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Register another new user
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "testuser2",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Register a duplicate user (should fail)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "testuser1",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Login with valid credentials
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "testuser1",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Login with invalid credentials (wrong password)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "testuser1",
    "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### Login with a non-existent user
POST http://localhost:8000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "nonexistent",
    "password": "password123"
}

### for future protected routes
### Access a protected route (replace <TOKEN> with a valid token)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/auth/user-info


### Access a protected route with an invalid token
GET http://localhost:8000/api/auth/protected
Authorization: Bearer invalidtoken

### Access a protected route without a token
GET http://localhost:8000/api/auth/protected
